==========================================================================
STEP 10: recovery - restart h3 and let the policy find it again
==========================================================================
  h3's web server is started again.  Nothing tells the selection logic
  about it: the next health check simply sees h3 answering, so h3 is a
  candidate again and is chosen like any other server.
  --- health check (h3 should be UP again) ---
     h2 10.0.0.11  UP       0.3 ms
     h3 10.0.0.12  UP       0.2 ms
     h4 10.0.0.13  UP       0.2 ms
